<title>SPAIN: FORECAST -Spain's Banco Popular 96 attrib seen up.</title>
<headline>FORECAST -Spain's Banco Popular 96 attrib seen up.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Market forecasts for 1996 results of Spanish bank Banco Popular. Simple averages of analysts' forecasts.</p>
<p>(In billions of pesetas).</p>
<p>				    1996	  1995	    RANGE</p>
<p>    Net interest income    177.56     170.58    173.24 - 177.90</p>
<p>    Operating income	 121.14     114.91    119.47 - 122.81</p>
<p>    Net attributable	  61.40	57.48     60.97 - 61.60</p>
<p>    EPS (pesetas)	     2,125	1,989     2,110 - 2,133</p>
<p>Contributors: BBV Interactivos, Argentaria Bolsa, Beta Capital, Benito y Monjardin, Ahorro Corporacion and Renta 4.</p>
<p>Banco Popular is expected to release its results on January 14.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom + 34 1 585-2167</p>
</text>
